Step-by-Step Pruning Plan to Restore Speed

Since Lightning AI Studios is down, you need to ruthlessly strip your local editor down to only what you are actively using right this second.

1. Disable the Duplicates (Drop to 1 Active Agent)

If you are driving your codebase using Cline, you do not need Kilo Code or Spark background engines running at the exact same time.
