• It Eradicates Hallucinations Entirely: When standard models fail, it’s because they guess as they type. By forcing a dedicated "Pre-Execution Assessment" and "Note-Trading" phase, you force the AI to verify its constraints ("Does this APK context match that mount path?") before writing a single block of code.
• Absolute Resource Efficiency: You are keeping your CPU cool when it matters most. Units 1 and 3 run light text-parsing scripts inside your fast 4GB physical DDR5 pool, keeping your Cursorless voice engine lag-free while they think. The heavy math is compressed and isolated to Units 2 and 4 inside your 12GB zRAM.
